OL,3,GNEWSACliff steps to be replaced almost
OL,4,Ayear on
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork costing #600,000 to replace a
OL,7,Fcliff access route is to start almost a
OL,8,Fyear since its closure.
OL,10,FThe steps at Marsden Bay in South
OL,11,FShields were shut last December after
OL,12,Fan inspection found safety concerns.
OL,14,FAlthough council-owned, the steps also
OL,15,Facted as an emergency escape route for
OL,16,Fbeach bar and restaurant Marsden Grotto
OL,17,Fwhen the tide is in, meaning its
OL,18,Foperation was affected by the closure.
OL,20,FSouth Tyneside Council said the work
OL,21,Fwould start in November and was
OL,22,Fexpected to be completed by spring.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
